cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SAMOSA: a step auditor for matrix derivations"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hussain
    given-names: Hussain
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hussain004/SAMOSA"
url: "https://samosa-math.vercel.app"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  SAMOSA checks every step of a matrix algebra, matrix calculus and
  probability derivation by evaluating it on sampled instances, exactly over
  finite fields, and reports a wrong step with a small counterexample and a
  fix.
keywords:
  - mathematics
  - linear algebra
  - matrix calculus
  - formal verification
  - linter
